	BD=|1908|
	PS=|Will Stewart, Nils O. Sonderlund|
	NT=|Born in Arizona Territory in 1908, he arrived in New Mexico in a covered wagon
	in 1915. His first story was published in 1928. He was one of the most popular SF
	writers of the 1930's. He received a Ph.D. in 1950's and was an English professor
	at Eastern New Mexico University for many years. HE has written 52 novel and over
	100 shorter stories. See his excellent autobiography,
	<i>Wonder's Child: My Life in Science Fiction</i>, for more details.|
